-schedule.html\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-icons/bh-icons2/icons2-schedule.jpg\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-icons/bh-icons2/icons2-schedule.jpg\" width=\"75\" height=\"24\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Black Hat Europe 2005 Briefings Schedule\"></a></font></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><font size=\"2\"><a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Sponsors\" href=\"bh-eu-06-sponsors.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/bh-eu-06-sponsors.html\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-icons/bh-icons2/icons2-sponsors.jpg\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-icons/bh-icons2/icons2-sponsors.jpg\" width=\"75\" height=\"24\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Black Hat Europe 2005 Sponsors\"></a></font></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><font size=\"2\"><a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Training\" href=\"train-bh-eu-06-index.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/train-bh-eu-06-index.html\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-icons/bh-icons2/icons2-trainer2.jpg\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-icons/bh-icons2/icons2-trainer2.jpg\" width=\"75\" height=\"25\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Black Hat Europe 2005 Training\"></a></font></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><font size=\"2\"><a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Hotel &amp; Venue\" href=\"bh-eu-06-venue.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/bh-eu-06-venue.html\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-icons/bh-icons2/icons2-hotel.jpg\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-icons/bh-icons2/icons2-hotel.jpg\" width=\"58\" height=\"24\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Black Hat Europe 2005 Hotel &amp; Venue\"></a></font></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><font size=\"2\"><a title=\"Black Hat Registration\" href=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-registration/bh-registration.html#eu\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-registration/bh-registration.html#eu\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-icons/bh-icons2/icons2-registration2.jpg\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-icons/bh-icons2/icons2-registration2.jpg\" width=\"75\" height=\"25\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Black Hat Europe 2005 Registration\"></a></font></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody></table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</csobj></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td valign=\"top\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-links/details.gif\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-links/details.gif\" width=\"144\" height=\"32\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Briefings details\"></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" bgcolor=\"black\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"black\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"black\" valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><span class=\"textred12\"><font color=\"red\"><b>Black Hat Europe 2006 Briefings and Training</b></font><font color=\"white\"><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</font></span>Grand Hotel Krasnapolsky, Amsterdam, the Netherlands</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"red\"><b><a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Training \" href=\"train-bh-eu-06-index.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/train-bh-eu-06-index.html\">Training:</a></b></font><font color=\"white\"> 28 February-1 March 2006<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</font><font color=\"red\"><b>Briefings:</b></font><font color=\"white\"> 2-3 March 2006<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"textred10\"><b><a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Registration\" href=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-registration/bh-registration.html#eu\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-registration/bh-registration.html#eu\">Registration:</a></b></span> On-line Registration is now closed. Seats are available for Training and the Briefings. </font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textpaleturqouis8\">You may register at the Black Hat registration desk prior to the start of the conference. To expedite your onsite registration, please download and complete the <a title=\"Black Hat Europe On-site Registration form\" href=\"regforms/On-site-Reg-Form-Eu06.pdf\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/regforms/On-site-Reg-Form-Eu06.pdf\" target=\"_top\">On-site Registration Form.</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textpaleturqouis8\">Bring the completed <a title=\"Black Hat Europe On-site Registration form\" href=\"regforms/On-site-Reg-Form-Eu06.pdf\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/regforms/On-site-Reg-Form-Eu06.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">form</a> along with your payment. Payment methods accepted: Mastercard, Visa, American Express, traveler cheque and cash. Payments via wire are not accepted for on-site registration. If possible, please register the evening prior to the start of the event to avoid long queues the following morning.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"white\"><b></b></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font color=\"white\" face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"3\"></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#dcdcdc\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"64\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody><tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Sponsors\" href=\"bh-eu-06-sponsors.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/bh-eu-06-sponsors.html\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-europe-06/bh-eu-06-sponsor-gif.gif\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-europe-06/bh-eu-06-sponsor-gif.gif\" alt=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Sponsors\" height=\"75\" width=\"175\" border=\"0\"></a></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"textsilver8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textblack8\"><b>How to contact us</b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textblack8\">general information:<br>info at blackhat døt com</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textblack8\">registration<br>europe-reg at blackhat døt com)via telephone: <br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textblack8\">via facsimile:<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ 1 206 219 4143</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"textsilver8\"><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"textsilver8\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-training/bh-training-dsd-logo-175px.jpg\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-training/bh-training-dsd-logo-175px.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"117\" width=\"175\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody></table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"black\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"black\" valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\">Black Hat Europe Presentations are now <a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Presentations\" href=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-media-archives/bh-archives-2006.html#eu-06\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-media-archives/bh-archives-2006.html#eu-06\" target=\"_blank\">online.</a> </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\">See the <a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Ad\" href=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-europe-06/bh-eu-06-advert.pdf\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/images/bh-europe-06/bh-eu-06-advert.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"textred10bold\">Black Hat Europe 2006 Ad.</span></a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Briefings Schedule\" href=\"bh-eu-06-schedule.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/bh-eu-06-schedule.html\"><font color=\"red\"><b>Black Hat </b></font><b><font color=\"red\">Europe 2006</font></b><font color=\"red\"><b> Briefings Schedule.</b></font></a><font color=\"white\"> There will be 4 different tracks over 2 days comprised of over 20 internationally renown security professionals speaking. </font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"white\">Selected </font><a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Briefings Speakers\" href=\"bh-eu-06-speakers.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/bh-eu-06-speakers.html\"><font color=\"red\"><b>Black Hat </b></font><b><font color=\"red\">Europe 2006</font></b><font color=\"red\"><b> Briefings Speakers.</b></font></a><font color=\"white\"> Topic titles, presentation abstracts and speaker biographies may be found here. The keynote will be Eric Litt, CSO of GM.</font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"white\">Selected </font><a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Training \" href=\"train-bh-eu-06-index.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/train-bh-eu-06-index.html\"><font color=\"red\"><b>Black Hat </b></font><b><font color=\"red\">Europe 2006</font></b><font color=\"red\"><b> Training.</b></font></a><font color=\"red\"><b> </b></font>See the <a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Training Schedule\" href=\"train-bh-eu-06-schedule.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/train-bh-eu-06-schedule.html\">training schedule.</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"#adff2f\">New Classes:</font><span class=\"textwhite8\"> </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"textwhite8\"><span class=\"textwhite8\"><a title=\"Black Hat Training: Advanced Database Security Assessment\" href=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-federal-06/train-bh-fed-06-ngs-data.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-federal-06/train-bh-fed-06-ngs-data.html\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Advanced Database Security Assessment<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</b></a>NGS Software</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li class=\"textwhite8\"><span class=\"textwhite8\"><a title=\"The Exploit Laboratory - Buffer Overflows For Beginners\" href=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-federal-06/train-bh-fed-06-ss-el.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-federal-06/train-bh-fed-06-ss-el.html\" target=\"_blank\"><b>The Exploit Laboratory - Buffer Overflows For Beginners<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</b></a>Saumil Udayan Shah</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"white\">See who our current </font><b><font color=\"red\"><a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Sponsors\" href=\"bh-eu-06-sponsors.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/bh-eu-06-sponsors.html\">Black Hat Europe 2006 Briefings Sponsors.</a></font></b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"red\"><b><a title=\"Black Hat Europe 2006 Hotel &amp; Venue\" href=\"bh-eu-06-venue.html\" tppabs=\"https://blackhat.com/html/bh-europe-06/bh-eu-06-venue.html\">Hotel &amp; Venue</a></b> </font><font color=\"white\">information for Black Hat Europe 2006 Briefings and Training. You must regi